{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13654","headline":"题鲍行军小阁 · 严维","name":"题鲍行军小阁","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"宇下无留事，经营意独新。\n文房已得地，相阁是推轮。\n席上招贤急，山阴对雪频。\n虚明先旦暮，啓闭异冬春。\n谈笑兵家法，逢迎幕府宾。\n还将负暄处，时借在阴人。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"严维","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13654.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13654","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}